  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 528.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to define the criteria and procedures for conditional discharge of a person involuntarily admitted to a designated receiving facility (DRF) and for the revision and revocation of the conditional discharge.\n\nSource. #6215, eff 3-30-96, EXPIRED: 12-31-98\n\nNew. #7063, eff 7-24-99, EXPIRED: 7-24-07\n\nNew. #9061, eff 1-3-08; ss by #11009, INTERIM, eff 1-3-16, EXPIRES: 7-1-16; ss by #11125, eff 7-1-16",
